# CineScout Production Intelligence Environment Configuration

# 1. Google Gemini API Key (From Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Parallel Search API Key (From https://platform.parallel.ai/)
PARALLEL_API_KEY=your_parallel_api_key_here

# 3. Optional: Google Cloud Project / Vertex AI settings (if using Vertex AI instead of Google AI Studio)
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your_project_id
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=us-central1
